{"id":"n38260-1-8","stage":1,"title":"꽃병 · 花瓶","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38260-1-8-1","ko":"나 오늘 졸업식에서 꽃다발 받았어.","zh":"我今天在毕业典礼上收到了花束。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"졸업식에서","meaning":"毕业典礼","explanation":"졸업식：毕业典礼；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"졸업식","audio":"/audio/4a0af5b7df82c96a1c24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75874","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸업식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽃다발","meaning":"花束","explanation":"꽃다발：花束","readings":[{"term":"꽃다발","audio":"/audio/aedd43ab44e7f1949113.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38220","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃다발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받았어.","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"4a0af5b7df82c96a","term":"졸업식","zh":"毕业典礼","audio":"/audio/4a0af5b7df82c96a1c24.mp3","entryId":"75874","definition":"纪念学生修完由学校规定的全部课程而举行的仪式。","pronunciation":["조럽씩"]},{"id":"aedd43ab44e7f194","term":"꽃다발","zh":"花束","audio":"/audio/aedd43ab44e7f1949113.mp3","entryId":"38220","definition":"许多枝花扎到一起。","pronunciation":["꼳따발"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bfda2eab68182b62ced1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38260-1-8-2","ko":"집에 있는 꽃병에 꽂아 두면 예쁘겠다.","zh":"插在家里的花瓶里应该会很好看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽃병에","meaning":"花瓶","explanation":"꽃병：花瓶；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"꽃병","audio":"/audio/e02337ff0599809387f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38260","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽂아","meaning":"插","explanation":"꽂다：插；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"꽂다","audio":"/audio/3781a022a4ddbaed1cbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14413","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽂다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두면","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘겠다.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106"